{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>And ships from the coast of Kittim.</b> Great ships from the coast of the Arameans going forth, as in ״וצי אדיר לא יעברנו״." "<b>And they shall afflict Assyria.</b> Even though Assyria will grow great, as He said above: ״עד מה אשור תשבך״." "<b>And they shall afflict Ever.</b> The children of Israel." "<b>And he too shall perish forever.</b> And he too — after Aram rules over the entire world — shall perish forever in the days of King Messiah. And because he saw all the nations ceasing in the days of the Messiah, he would lament and say: אוי מי יחיה משומו אל."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:10:10.631794933Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}